  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Deploying crew-served Sniper artillery pieces, these platoons provide medium-weight indirect fire support capable of reaching targets at considerable distance. The Sniper's greater range and hitting power compared to the Thumper make it the preferred artillery piece for sustained bombardment missions.</p>"
